---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { pageTitle } from "@/lib/seo";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle("Privacy")} description="How UX Patterns Guide handles analytics and newsletter subscriptions.">
  <article class="policy-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p>
    <h1>Privacy at UX Patterns Guide</h1>
    <p class="policy-lead">We collect only what is needed to improve the catalog and deliver the newsletter you request.</p>

    <h2>Newsletter</h2>
    <p>When you subscribe, we store your email address, confirmation status, signup page, consent version, and relevant campaign label. We use this information only to confirm and deliver the UX Patterns newsletter.</p>
    <p>Subscription records are stored in Google Cloud Firestore. Email delivery may be processed by Resend. We do not sell subscriber information.</p>

    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>We use Umami to understand aggregate visits and interactions such as searches, pattern opens, Lab use, sharing, and newsletter success. Analytics events must not contain email addresses or free-form text.</p>

    <h2>Your choices</h2>
    <p>Every newsletter includes an unsubscribe route. You may also request access or deletion by emailing <a href="mailto:artpar@gmail.com">artpar@gmail.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Last updated</h2>
    <p><time datetime="2026-08-30">August 30, 2026</time></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
